<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 36.2.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 36.2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 35,000 shares in Polish food producer Farm Food SA at 36.2 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Farm Food closed at 32.5 zlotys in a volume of 3,248 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
